{
  "id": "electrical_series_circuits",
  "title": "Electrical Series Circuits",
  "description": "Calculate total resistance, current, and power in a series circuit with multiple resistors connected to a voltage source.",
  "type": "chart-table",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Series Circuit Rules\n\n1. The total current in the circuit is equal to the current in any other part of the circuit.\n2. The total voltage in a series circuit is equal to the sum of the voltages across all parts in the circuit.\n3. The total resistance in a series circuit is equal to the resistances of all parts in the circuit.\n\n### Key Equations\n\n- **Total Voltage**: U = U1 + U2 + ... + Un\n- **Ohm's Law**: Un = In × Rn\n- **Equal Currents**: I1 = I2 = ... = In\n- **Total Resistance**: R = R1 + R2 + ... + Rn\n- **Power**: P = R × I²"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "voltage",
          "label": "Applied Voltage (U)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "V",
          "defaultValue": 12
        },
        {
          "id": "r1",
          "label": "Resistance 1 (R1)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "Ω",
          "defaultValue": 1.25
        },
        {
          "id": "r2",
          "label": "Resistance 2 (R2)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "Ω",
          "defaultValue": 0.5
        },
        {
          "id": "r3",
          "label": "Resistance 3 (R3)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "Ω",
          "defaultValue": 1.5
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "total_resistance",
          "label": "Total Resistance (R)",
          "formula": "inputs.r1 + inputs.r2 + inputs.r3",
          "unit": "Ω",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "current",
          "label": "Circuit Current (I)",
          "formula": "inputs.voltage / (inputs.r1 + inputs.r2 + inputs.r3)",
          "unit": "A",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "power",
          "label": "Power Dissipated (P)",
          "formula": "(inputs.r1 + inputs.r2 + inputs.r3) * (inputs.voltage / (inputs.r1 + inputs.r2 + inputs.r3)) * (inputs.voltage / (inputs.r1 + inputs.r2 + inputs.r3))",
          "unit": "W",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "voltage_r1",
          "label": "Voltage across R1 (U1)",
          "formula": "inputs.r1 * (inputs.voltage / (inputs.r1 + inputs.r2 + inputs.r3))",
          "unit": "V",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "voltage_r2",
          "label": "Voltage across R2 (U2)",
          "formula": "inputs.r2 * (inputs.voltage / (inputs.r1 + inputs.r2 + inputs.r3))",
          "unit": "V",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "voltage_r3",
          "label": "Voltage across R3 (U3)",
          "formula": "inputs.r3 * (inputs.voltage / (inputs.r1 + inputs.r2 + inputs.r3))",
          "unit": "V",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Component",
        "Resistance (Ω)",
        "Current (A)",
        "Voltage (V)",
        "Power (W)"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "R1",
          "=inputs.r1",
          "=inputs.voltage / (inputs.r1 + inputs.r2 + inputs.r3)",
          "=inputs.r1 * (inputs.voltage / (inputs.r1 + inputs.r2 + inputs.r3))",
          "=inputs.r1 * (inputs.voltage / (inputs.r1 + inputs.r2 + inputs.r3)) * (inputs.voltage / (inputs.r1 + inputs.r2 + inputs.r3))"
        ],
        [
          "R2",
          "=inputs.r2",
          "=inputs.voltage / (inputs.r1 + inputs.r2 + inputs.r3)",
          "=inputs.r2 * (inputs.voltage / (inputs.r1 + inputs.r2 + inputs.r3))",
          "=inputs.r2 * (inputs.voltage / (inputs.r1 + inputs.r2 + inputs.r3)) * (inputs.voltage / (inputs.r1 + inputs.r2 + inputs.r3))"
        ],
        [
          "R3",
          "=inputs.r3",
          "=inputs.voltage / (inputs.r1 + inputs.r2 + inputs.r3)",
          "=inputs.r3 * (inputs.voltage / (inputs.r1 + inputs.r2 + inputs.r3))",
          "=inputs.r3 * (inputs.voltage / (inputs.r1 + inputs.r2 + inputs.r3)) * (inputs.voltage / (inputs.r1 + inputs.r2 + inputs.r3))"
        ],
        [
          "Total",
          "=inputs.r1 + inputs.r2 + inputs.r3",
          "=inputs.voltage / (inputs.r1 + inputs.r2 + inputs.r3)",
          "=inputs.voltage",
          "=(inputs.r1 + inputs.r2 + inputs.r3) * (inputs.voltage / (inputs.r1 + inputs.r2 + inputs.r3)) * (inputs.voltage / (inputs.r1 + inputs.r2 + inputs.r3))"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "chart",
      "options": {
        "title": {
          "text": "Series Circuit Analysis",
          "left": "center"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "trigger": "axis"
        },
        "legend": {
          "data": [
            "Resistance",
            "Voltage",
            "Power"
          ]
        },
        "xAxis": {
          "type": "category",
          "data": [
            "R1",
            "R2",
            "R3"
          ]
        },
        "yAxis": [
          {
            "type": "value",
            "name": "Resistance (Ω)"
          },
          {
            "type": "value",
            "name": "Voltage (V)"
          },
          {
            "type": "value",
            "name": "Power (W)"
          }
        ],
        "series": [
          {
            "name": "Resistance",
            "data": [
              "=inputs.r1",
              "=inputs.r2",
              "=inputs.r3"
            ],
            "type": "bar",
            "yAxisIndex": 0
          },
          {
            "name": "Voltage",
            "data": [
              "=inputs.r1 * (inputs.voltage / (inputs.r1 + inputs.r2 + inputs.r3))",
              "=inputs.r2 * (inputs.voltage / (inputs.r1 + inputs.r2 + inputs.r3))",
              "=inputs.r3 * (inputs.voltage / (inputs.r1 + inputs.r2 + inputs.r3))"
            ],
            "type": "line",
            "yAxisIndex": 1
          },
          {
            "name": "Power",
            "data": [
              "=inputs.r1 * (inputs.voltage / (inputs.r1 + inputs.r2 + inputs.r3)) * (inputs.voltage / (inputs.r1 + inputs.r2 + inputs.r3))",
              "=inputs.r2 * (inputs.voltage / (inputs.r1 + inputs.r2 + inputs.r3)) * (inputs.voltage / (inputs.r1 + inputs.r2 + inputs.r3))",
              "=inputs.r3 * (inputs.voltage / (inputs.r1 + inputs.r2 + inputs.r3)) * (inputs.voltage / (inputs.r1 + inputs.r2 + inputs.r3))"
            ],
            "type": "line",
            "yAxisIndex": 2
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}